      'The Sun also affects the tides, but because it is so much further away, its influence is less than half that of the Moon.',
      'Many coastal towns publish tide tables so that fishermen and swimmers can plan their day around the water.',
      'When the Sun and the Moon are lined up, at new moon and full moon, their effects combine to produce especially high and low tides.',
